  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher use of evasive techniques (proxies, reflagging, shell companies) disperses and obscures state-linked assets and revenue chains, making them harder for external claimants and courts to identify, attach or monetize under prevailing legal and political processes.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
