  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in sanctions‑evasion activity expands clandestine financial and commodity channels that actors can repurpose to transfer value to Russia, thereby augmenting funds available for the war effort.</data>
