</edge>
<edge source="global_energy_shock::asset_ownership_fragment" target="global_energy_shock::sovereign_asset_access" id="0">
  <data key="d27">intra_causal</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_energy_shock::asset_ownership_fragment" target="china_us_tech_trade::regulatory_scrutiny" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater fragmentation and opacity of oil‑asset ownership obscures links to foreign state actors, which triggers faster and broader regulatory reviews and restrictions on related cross‑border tech investments and partnerships.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">china_us_tech_trade</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_energy_shock::asset_ownership_fragment" target="global_bond_turmoil::central_bank_interventio" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater fragmentation of title and revenue claims in oil assets increases episodic payment and FX settlement frictions for oil exporters/importers, raising the likelihood and magnitude of central‑bank interventions to stabilise FX and domestic bond markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_turmoil</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_energy_shock::asset_ownership_fragment" target="russia_ukraine_war::wartime_funding_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">More fragmented ownership of oil assets and contracts creates opportunities for intermediary firms and opaque payment chains that can reroute proceeds to military procurement while evading sanctions, increasing flows that sustain operations.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_energy_shock::contract_enforceability" target="global_energy_shock::state_directed_economy" id="0">
  <data key="d27">intra_causal</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
