<edge source="china_us_tech_trade::capital_investment_ai" target="global_bond_turmoil::nonbank_funding_stress" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid surge in AI capital spending (VC rounds, project financing, M&amp;A) draws large tranches of term funding from private credit funds and asset managers, tightening available non‑bank liquidity and raising rollover and margin pressures in the shadow‑bank sector.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_us_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_turmoil</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_us_tech_trade::capital_investment_ai" target="global_energy_shock::asset_ownership_fragment" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A fall in private capital flows into AI (driven by trade frictions) reallocates financing toward large, state-backed energy projects and acquisitions by national oil firms, increasing consolidation and thereby reducing fragmentation of oil asset ownership.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_us_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_us_tech_trade::capital_investment_ai" target="russia_ukraine_war::cyber_intrusion_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Large capital inflows accelerate development and commercialization of offensive AI tooling and specialist contractor capacity (automated exploit discovery, malware generation, intrusion-as-a-service), which directly increases the frequency and sophistication of cyber intrusions against actors in the Russia–Ukraine context.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_us_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="china_us_tech_trade::capital_investment_ai" target="russia_ukraine_war::external_security_coop" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Expanded commercial and defense AI investment in the US and allied firms produces deployable ISR, analytics and secure-communications products that governments and partners rapidly use to coordinate military assistance and intelligence sharing for Ukraine, strengthening external security cooperation among those partners.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_us_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
